sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant OC as oc adm must-gather
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod
    participant Gather as gather.sh
    participant Detect as xks_util.sh
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 1: OpenShift Must-Gather Collection
        Admin->>OC: oc adm must-gather --image=odh-must-gather
        OC->>Pod: Launch pod with SA token
        Pod->>Gather: Execute /usr/bin/gather
        Gather->>Detect: Detect K8s distribution
        Detect->>K8sAPI: GET infrastructures.config.openshift.io<br/>SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Detect: OpenShift detected
        Gather->>Gather: Set OpenShift namespaces<br/>(redhat-ods-*, rhods-*)

        par Parallel Component Collection
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (KServe CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (DSP CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (Dashboard CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (KubeRay CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (Training CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (Model Registry CRs)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect (AI Gateway CRs)<br/>SA token
            Note right of K8sAPI: + Kueue, TrustyAI, Feast,<br/>LlamaStack, MLflow, Spark,<br/>MCP, Gateway API, Istio,<br/>cert-manager CRs
        end

        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Resource YAML + Pod Logs
        Pod->>Pod: Write to /must-gather/
        OC->>Admin: rsync collected data<br/>TLS 1.2+ via kubeconfig
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 2: xKS (Non-OpenShift) Must-Gather Collection
        Admin->>Pod: kubectl apply -f must-gather-job.yaml
        Pod->>Gather: Execute /usr/bin/gather
        Gather->>Detect: Detect K8s distribution
        Detect->>K8sAPI: GET nodes (check labels/providerID)<br/>SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Detect: AKS/EKS/CKS detected

        Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl api-resources<br/>(auto-discover all resource types)
        K8sAPI-->>Gather: Available API resources

        par Parallel xKS Collection
            Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect (LLM-D resources)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect (cert-manager)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect (Sail/Istio)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect (LeaderWorkerSet)<br/>SA token
            Gather->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect (Observability)<br/>SA token
            Note right of K8sAPI: + Gateway API, KEDA,<br/>batch-gateway resources
        end

        Gather->>K8sAPI: helm list / helm get values<br/>(Helm release info)
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Resource YAML + Pod Logs
        Pod->>Pod: Write to /tmp/must-gather/
        Admin->>Pod: kubectl cp<br/>TLS 1.2+ via kubeconfig
        Pod-->>Admin: Collected diagnostic data
    end
